{"id":"correctamente","lemma":"correctamente","pos":"adv","rank":2771,"glosses":["correctly"],"ipa":"/koˌreɡtaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Emanuelps27-correctamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"No lo hice correctamente.","en":"I didn't do that right.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/430417","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},null]},{"text":"¿Ellos oyeron correctamente?","en":"Did they hear correctly?","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to hear","l":"oír"},null]},{"text":"La puerta del coche no cierra correctamente.","en":"The car door doesn't close properly.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"car, automobile"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to close, to shut","l":"cerrar"},null]},{"text":"Solo tienes una oportunidad para responder correctamente.","en":"You have only one chance to answer correctly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/64826","words":[{"g":"sole"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"opportunity"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to answer, to reply"},null]},{"text":"Alguien no la ha traducido correctamente.","en":"Someone didn't translate it correctly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/741186","words":[{"g":"someone, somebody"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"translated"},null]}]}